WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:01.968
-Here's how the game works.

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.202
On our phones,
we're each gonna get

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:04.637
a couple of "fill in the blank"
style prompts,

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:07.807
like "A good name for a singles
bar for pirates is blank."

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:09.776
Then we each secretly type in
the funniest answer

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:11.477
that we can think of,
and when we're done,

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:13.646
two answers will go head-to-head
on the big screen,

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.981
and the other players,
along with The Roots,

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:17.016
will vote on which one
they think is funnier,

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:19.719
but you don't know whose answer
is whose until after you vote.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:21.988
Okay. Let's all take our seats
and grab our phones.

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.889
Here we go.
And let's start this game up.

00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:25.925
Quiplash.
Let's do it.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.494
-Sit back and relax.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:30.196
-Yeah.

